      "content": "i know there's medicine for the pain, but it doesn't change the fact that i'm just a burden to everyone. my kids are so busy with their own lives, and i hate that they have to worry about me constantly. i feel like i'm just taking up space and time that doesn't belong to me anymore. it's like i'm just a shadow of who i used to be, just lingering around.",
